<title>DENMARK: Danish Jan wholesale prices up 1.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Danish Jan wholesale prices up 1.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish wholesale prices rose by 0.1 percent in January 1997 from December 1996 and were up 1.0 percent from January 1996, the national statistics office said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>					Jan 1997   Dec  1996   Jan 1996</p>
<p>    Change on month (percent)    +0.1	+0.4	    +0.3</p>
<p>    Change on year (percent)     +1.0	+1.2	    +1.5</p>
<p>    Index (base year 1990=100)  104.6     104.5	   103.6</p>
<p>NOTE - The statistics office changed the index base year to 1990 from 1980, effective April 1994. Analysts had forecast an average 1.2-percent yr/yr WPI rise for January and a 0.3-percent rise on the month. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
